 keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="42">Got it — you’re asking about <strong data-start="29" data-end="39">MkDocs</strong>.</p>
<p data-start="44" data-end="290">MkDocs is a <strong data-start="56" data-end="81">static site generator</strong> designed for building <strong data-start="104" data-end="129">project documentation</strong> using <strong data-start="136" data-end="148">Markdown</strong> files. It’s fast, simple, and commonly used for developer documentation, often paired with the <strong data-start="244" data-end="267">Material for MkDocs</strong> theme for a modern UI.</p>
<p data-start="292" data-end="316">Here’s a quick overview:</p>
<h3 data-section-id="1xbhbw2" data-start="318" data-end="337">🔹 Key Features</h3>
<ul data-start="338" data-end="746">
<li data-section-id="1bl1vd2" data-start="338" data-end="393">
<p data-start="340" data-end="393"><strong data-start="340" data-end="358">Markdown-based</strong> → Write docs in plain <code data-start="381" data-end="386">.md</code> files.</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1npczf5" data-start="394" data-end="456">
<p data-start="396" data-end="456"><strong data-start="396" data-end="421">Static site generator</strong> → Outputs clean HTML, CSS, and JS.</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="3xofxv" data-start="457" data-end="544">
<p data-start="459" data-end="544"><strong data-start="459" data-end="469">Themes</strong> → Includes built-in themes and supports third-party ones (e.g., Material).</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1mqsg0i" data-start="545" data-end="632">
<p data-start="547" data-end="632"><strong data-start="547" data-end="561">Navigation</strong> → Automatically builds navigation menus from your <code data-start="612" data-end="624">mkdocs.yml</code> config.</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="23c37g" data-start="633" data-end="680">
<p data-start="635" data-end="680"><strong data-start="635" data-end="645">Search</strong> → Full-text search out of the box.</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="lxroh1" data-start="681" data-end="746">
<p data-start="683" data-end="746"><strong data-start="683" data-end="697">Extensible</strong> → Plugins for versioning, diagrams, macros, etc.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="748" data-end="751">
<h3 data-section-id="zcae2l" data-start="753" data-end="771">🔹 Basic Usage</h3>
<ol data-start="773" data-end="859" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">
