<p data-start="26" data-end="147">In Angular Material dialogs, <code data-start="55" data-end="72">MAT_DIALOG_DATA</code> is <strong data-start="76" data-end="90">not a type</strong>, it’s an <strong data-start="100" data-end="119">injection token</strong>.<br data-start="120" data-end="123">
So you <strong data-start="130" data-end="140">cannot</strong> write:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="149" data-end="195"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="sticky z-2 select-none top-(--sticky-padding-top)"><div class="flex w-full items-center justify-between py-1.5 ps-4 pe-1.5 font-sans md:ps-5 bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary"><div class="flex max-w-[75%] min-w-0 cursor-default items-center text-sm font-medium justify-self-start text-token-text-primary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm me-2.5 shrink-0"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-dd80ba6x.svg#e45ab3" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>TypeScript</div><div class="flex flex-row items-center gap-0.5 justify-self-end"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-dd80ba6x.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div></div></div><div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-4 top-12 bottom-4"><div class="pointer-events-none sticky z-40 shrink-0 z-1!" style="top: calc(calc(var(--sticky-padding-top) + 48px) - 1px * 3); margin-bottom: calc(-4px); height: calc(4px); mask-image: linear-gradient(transparent 25%, white 75%);"><div class="sticky bg-token-border-light" style="top: calc(var(--sticky-padding-top) + 48px); height: 1px;"></div></div></div><div class="w-full overflow-x-hidden overflow-y-auto" style="transform: none; max-height: 433px;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼ5 ͼj"><div class="cm-scroller"><div class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly"><span class="ͼe">private </span><span class="ͼg">_dialogData</span><span>: </span><span class="ͼe">MAT_DIALOG_DATA</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="197" data-end="231">That’s why TypeScript complains:</p>
<blockquote data-start="233" data-end="306">
<p data-start="235" data-end="306"><code data-start="235" data-end="306">'MAT_DIALOG_DATA' refers to a value, but is being used as a type here</code></p>
</blockquote>
<hr data-start="308" data-end="311">
<h3 data-section-id="3dcrqq" data-start="313" data-end="330">✅ Correct Way</h3>
<p data-start="331" data-end="399">Use the <code data-start="339" data-end="348">@Inject</code> decorator when you want to inject the dialog data:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="401" data-end="869"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="sticky z-2 select-none top-(--sticky-padding-top)"><div class="flex w-full items-center justify-between py-1.5 ps-4 pe-1.5 font-sans md:ps-5 bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary"><div class="flex max-w-[75%] min-w-0 cursor-default items-center text-sm font-medium justify-self-start text-token-text-primary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm me-2.5 shrink-0"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-dd80ba6x.svg#e45ab3" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>TypeScript</div><div class="flex flex-row items-center gap-0.5 justify-self-end"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-dd80ba6x.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div></div></div><div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-4 top-12 bottom-4"><div class="pointer-events-none sticky z-40 shrink-0 z-1!" style="top: calc(calc(var(--sticky-padding-top) + 48px) - 1px * 3); margin-bottom: calc(-4px); height: calc(4px); mask-image: linear-gradient(transparent 25%, white 75%);"><div class="sticky bg-token-border-light" style="top: calc(var(--sticky-padding-top) + 48px); height: 1px;"></div></div></div><div class="w-full overflow-x-hidden overflow-y-auto" style="transform: none; max-height: 433px;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼ5 ͼj"><div class="cm-scroller"><div class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly"><span class="ͼ8">import</span><span> { </span><span class="ͼe">Component</span><span>, </span><span class="ͼe">Inject</span><span> } </span><span class="ͼ8">from</span><span> </span><span class="ͼc">'@angular/core'</span><span>;</span><br><span class="ͼ8">import</span><span> { </span><span class="ͼe">MAT_DIALOG_DATA</span><span>, </span><span class="ͼe">MatDialogRef</span><span> } </span><span class="ͼ8">from</span><span> </span><span class="ͼc">'@angular/material/dialog'</span><span>;</span><br><br><span class="ͼ7">@</span><span class="ͼe">Component</span><span>({</span><br><span>  selector: </span><span class="ͼc">'app-surgical-history-data-view'</span><span>,</span><br><span>  templateUrl: </span><span class="ͼc">'./surgical-history-data-view.component.html'</span><span>,</span><br><span>})</span><br><span class="ͼ8">export</span><span> </span><span class="ͼ8">class</span><span> </span><span class="ͼd">SurgicalHistoryDataViewComponent</span><span> {</span><br><span>  constructor(</span><br><span>    </span><span class="ͼ8">private</span><span> </span><span class="ͼe">_dialogRef</span><span>: </span><span class="ͼe">MatDialogRef</span><span>&lt;</span><span class="ͼe">SurgicalHistoryDataViewComponent</span><span>&gt;,</span><br><span>    </span><span class="ͼ7">@</span><span class="ͼe">Inject</span><span>(</span><span class="ͼe">MAT_DIALOG_DATA</span><span>) </span><span class="ͼ8">public</span><span> </span><span class="ͼe">_dialogData</span><span>: </span><span class="ͼe">any</span><span>   </span><span class="ͼ6">// 👈 FIX</span><br><span>  ) {}</span><br><span>}</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<hr data-start="871" data-end="874">
<h3 data-section-id="82s25n" data-start="876" data-end="895">🔹 Explanation:</h3>
<ul data-start="896" data-end="1120">
<li data-section-id="4apxup" data-start="896" data-end="983">
<p data-start="898" data-end="983"><code data-start="898" data-end="915">MAT_DIALOG_DATA</code> is an <strong data-start="922" data-end="940">InjectionToken</strong> (a runtime object), not a TypeScript type.</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="d1thjg" data-start="984" data-end="1052">
<p data-start="986" data-end="1052">To use it in DI, you must wrap it with <code data-start="1025" data-end="1051">@Inject(MAT_DIALOG_DATA)</code>.</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1wq65bj" data-start="1053" data-end="1120">
<p data-start="1055" data-end="1120">If you want stronger typing, replace <code data-start="1092" data-end="1097">any</code> with your model, e.g.:</p>
</li>
</ul>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="1122" data-end="1185"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="sticky z-2 select-none top-(--sticky-padding-top)"><div class="flex w-full items-center justify-between py-1.5 ps-4 pe-1.5 font-sans md:ps-5 bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary"><div class="flex max-w-[75%] min-w-0 cursor-default items-center text-sm font-medium justify-self-start text-token-text-primary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm me-2.5 shrink-0"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-dd80ba6x.svg#e45ab3" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>TypeScript</div><div class="flex flex-row items-center gap-0.5 justify-self-end"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-dd80ba6x.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div></div></div><div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-4 top-12 bottom-4"><div class="pointer-events-none sticky z-40 shrink-0 z-1!" style="top: calc(calc(var(--sticky-padding-top) + 48px) - 1px * 3); margin-bottom: calc(-4px); height: calc(4px); mask-image: linear-gradient(transparent 25%, white 75%);"><div class="sticky bg-token-border-light" style="top: calc(var(--sticky-padding-top) + 48px); height: 1px;"></div></div></div><div class="w-full overflow-x-hidden overflow-y-auto" style="transform: none; max-height: 433px;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼ5 ͼj"><div class="cm-scroller"><div class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly"><span class="ͼ7">@</span><span class="ͼe">Inject</span><span>(</span><span class="ͼe">MAT_DIALOG_DATA</span><span>) </span><span class="ͼe">public </span><span class="ͼg">_dialogData</span><span>: </span><span class="ͼe">EmpModel</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
