You <strong data-start="48" data-end="97">can’t use <code data-start="60" data-end="69">@Inject</code> in a property declaration</strong> like that. It must be used <strong data-start="125" data-end="162">in the constructor parameter list</strong>.</p>
<p data-start="165" data-end="191">Here’s the correct syntax:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="193" data-end="904"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="sticky z-2 select-none top-(--sticky-padding-top)"><div class="flex w-full items-center justify-between py-1.5 ps-4 pe-1.5 font-sans md:ps-5 bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary"><div class="flex max-w-[75%] min-w-0 cursor-default items-center text-sm font-medium justify-self-start text-token-text-primary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm me-2.5 shrink-0"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-dd80ba6x.svg#e45ab3" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>TypeScript</div><div class="flex flex-row items-center gap-0.5 justify-self-end"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-dd80ba6x.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div></div></div><div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-4 top-12 bottom-4"><div class="pointer-events-none sticky z-40 shrink-0 z-1!" style="top: calc(calc(var(--sticky-padding-top) + 48px) - 1px * 3); margin-bottom: calc(-4px); height: calc(4px); mask-image: linear-gradient(transparent 25%, white 75%);"><div class="sticky bg-token-border-light" style="top: calc(var(--sticky-padding-top) + 48px); height: 1px;"></div></div></div><div class="w-full overflow-x-hidden overflow-y-auto" style="transform: none; max-height: 433px;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼ5 ͼj"><div class="cm-scroller"><div class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly"><span class="ͼ8">import</span><span> { </span><span class="ͼe">Component</span><span>, </span><span class="ͼe">Inject</span><span>, </span><span class="ͼe">OnInit</span><span> } </span><span class="ͼ8">from</span><span> </span><span class="ͼc">'@angular/core'</span><span>;</span><br><span class="ͼ8">import</span><span> { </span><span class="ͼe">MAT_DIALOG_DATA</span><span>, </span><span class="ͼe">MatDialogRef</span><span> } </span><span class="ͼ8">from</span><span> </span><span class="ͼc">'@angular/material/dialog'</span><span>;</span><br><span class="ͼ8">import</span><span> { </span><span class="ͼe">PastSurgery</span><span> } </span><span class="ͼ8">from</span><span> </span><span class="ͼc">'../models/past-surgery.model'</span><span>;</span><br><br><span class="ͼ7">@</span><span class="ͼe">Component</span><span>({</span><br><span>  selector: </span><span class="ͼc">'app-surgical-history-data-view'</span><span>,</span><br><span>  templateUrl: </span><span class="ͼc">'./surgical-history-data-view.component.html'</span><span>,</span><br><span>  styleUrls: [</span><span class="ͼc">'./surgical-history-data-view.component.css'</span><span>]</span><br><span>})</span><br><span class="ͼ8">export</span><span> </span><span class="ͼ8">class</span><span> </span><span class="ͼd">SurgicalHistoryDataViewComponent</span><span> </span><span class="ͼ8">implements</span><span> </span><span class="ͼe">OnInit</span><span> {</span><br><br><span>  constructor(</span><br><span>    </span><span class="ͼ8">private</span><span> </span><span class="ͼe">_dialogRef</span><span>: </span><span class="ͼe">MatDialogRef</span><span>&lt;</span><span class="ͼe">SurgicalHistoryDataViewComponent</span><span>&gt;,</span><br><span>    </span><span class="ͼ7">@</span><span class="ͼe">Inject</span><span>(</span><span class="ͼe">MAT_DIALOG_DATA</span><span>) </span><span class="ͼ8">public</span><span> </span><span class="ͼe">_dialogData</span><span>: </span><span class="ͼe">PastSurgery</span><span>[]   </span><span class="ͼ6">// ✅ correct usage</span><br><span>  ) {}</span><br><br><span>  ngOnInit(): </span><span class="ͼ8">void</span><span> {</span><br><span>    </span><span class="ͼe">console</span><span class="ͼ8">.</span><span>log(</span><span class="ͼc">'Dialog data:'</span><span>, </span><span class="ͼb">this</span><span class="ͼ8">.</span><span>_dialogData);</span><br><span>  }</span><br><span>}</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<hr data-start="906" data-end="909">
<h3 data-section-id="n5850x" data-start="911" data-end="928">✅ Key Points:</h3>
<ol data-start="929" data-end="1143">
<li data-section-id="1f5njm5" data-start="929" data-end="987">
<p data-start="932" data-end="987"><code data-start="932" data-end="949">MAT_DIALOG_DATA</code> is an <strong data-start="956" data-end="974">InjectionToken</strong>, not a type.</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="w03p85" data-start="988" data-end="1064">
<p data-start="991" data-end="1064">To inject it, you must use <code data-start="1018" data-end="1044">@Inject(MAT_DIALOG_DATA)</code> in the constructor.</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="wureda" data-start="1065" data-end="1143">
<p data-start="1068" data-end="1143">You can <strong data-start="1076" data-end="1093">strongly type</strong> the injected data (<code data-start="1113" data-end="1128">PastSurgery[]</code> in your case).</p>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start="1145" data-end="1148">
