   Ctrl+Shift+{ to close div
2. Ctrl+Shift+{ – Close the div
   Ctrl+Shift+} – Open the div
3. Shift+Alt+Down Arrow – Copy the same elements multiple times
4. Alt+Up Arrow / Alt+Down Arrow – Move a particular line up/down
5. Ctrl+Delete – to delete rightside word
6. Shift+Home – to copy right side total text
   Shift+End – to copy left side total text
7. Shift+Up/Down – Select lines
   Ctrl+/ – Comment/Uncomment selected lines
8. Ctrl+] – Move selected lines to the right
   Ctrl+[ – Move selected lines to the left
9. Ctrl+K W – Close all open tabs
10. ctrl+delete to delete left side content
11. ctrl+backspace to delete right side content
12. Delete Entire Line (Ctrl + Shift + K)
13. cut entire line (Ctrl + X)
14. to delete entire line (Shift + Delete)
15. to delete leftSide total content (Shift + End then Delete)
16. Ctrl+Left/Right Arrow – Move cursor word by word
17. Ctrl+K S – Open keyboard shortcut reference in VS Code
18. Ctrl+F4 or Ctrl+W – Close the current tab
19. Ctrl+T – Open a new tab
20. Ctrl+N – Open a new window
21. Ctrl+L – Go to the address/search bar
22. Ctrl+Shift+W – Close window and all tabs
23. Ctrl+Q – Close window
24. F12 – Go to Definition
25. Alt+F12 – Peek Definition
26. Ctrl+Click – Go to definition quickly
27. Ctrl+Shift+O – Show all symbols in the current file
28. Ctrl+P – Quickly open any file
29. Ctrl+Shift+P – Open Command Palette
30. i) Ctrl + Shift + K – delete entire line (right side content)
    ii) ctrl+delete – delete left side content
    iii) ctrl+backspace – move word by word (left)
31. Ctrl+Shift+\ – Move from { to its matching ending }
32. i) Windows + PrintScreen – full screenshot
    ii) Windows + Shift + S – select area screenshot
33. Select multiple lines and press TAB – move right (indent)
34. Select multiple lines and press Shift + TAB – move left
35. Windows + Arrow Keys – snap windows to left/right/top/bottom
36. Ctrl+F – Search for a value
37. Windows + D – minimize all windows
38. Ctrl+H – Replace text
39. Ctrl+Tab – switch between open files
40. Ctrl+J or Ctrl+Shift+~ – Open terminal</div></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex justify-end"><div aria-label="Your message actions" class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none touch:pointer-events-auto touch:opacity-100 duration-300 group-hover/turn-messages:delay-300 pointer-events-none opacity-0 motion-safe:transition-opacity group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:opacity-100 group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:opacity-100 has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:opacity-100" role="group" tabindex="-1" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Copy message" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-dd80ba6x.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></button><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Edit message" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-dd80ba6x.svg#6d87e1" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></button></div></div></div></div><span class="sr-only"><br></span></section><section class="text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh))