<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="1601" data-end="1701"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="sticky z-2 select-none top-(--sticky-padding-top)"><div class="flex w-full items-center justify-between py-1.5 ps-4 pe-1.5 font-sans md:ps-5 bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary"><div class="flex max-w-[75%] min-w-0 cursor-default items-center text-sm font-medium justify-self-start text-token-text-primary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm me-2.5 shrink-0"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-dd80ba6x.svg#e45ab3" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>YAML</div><div class="flex flex-row items-center gap-0.5 justify-self-end"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-dd80ba6x.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div></div></div><div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-4 top-12 bottom-4"><div class="pointer-events-none sticky z-40 shrink-0 z-1!" style="top: calc(calc(var(--sticky-padding-top) + 48px) - 1px * 3); margin-bottom: calc(-4px); height: calc(4px); mask-image: linear-gradient(transparent 25%, white 75%);"><div class="sticky bg-token-border-light" style="top: calc(var(--sticky-padding-top) + 48px); height: 1px;"></div></div></div><div class="w-full overflow-x-hidden overflow-y-auto" style="transform: none; max-height: 433px;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼ5 ͼj"><div class="cm-scroller"><div class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly"><span>extra_javascript:</span><br><span>  - assets/highlight-selection.js</span><br><br><span>extra_css:</span><br><span>  - assets/highlight.css</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<hr data-start="1703" data-end="1706">
<h3 data-section-id="1pxy8ai" data-start="1708" data-end="1721">🎉 Result</h3>
<ul data-start="1723" data-end="1861">
<li data-section-id="u69ln5" data-start="1723" data-end="1782">
<p data-start="1725" data-end="1782">Select any word → <strong data-start="1743" data-end="1782">all occurrences highlight instantly</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="xuss2y" data-start="1783" data-end="1841">
<p data-start="1785" data-end="1841">Click elsewhere → highlights disappear on next selection</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="pnn2y0" data-start="1842" data-end="1861">
<p data-start="1844" data-end="1861">No Ctrl+F needed.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="1863" data-end="1866">
<h2 data-section-id="tpxb5e" data-start="1868" data-end="1898">⚠️ Notes (just so you know)</h2>
<ul data-start="1900" data-end="2106">
<li data-section-id="194xj6u" data-start="1900" data-end="1966">
<p data-start="1902" data-end="1966">This runs only <strong data-start="1917" data-end="1940">on the current page</strong> (not across all pages).</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="32qygj" data-start="1967" data-end="2039">
<p data-start="1969" data-end="2039">Very large pages with thousands of words may highlight a bit slower.</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="r01opm" data-start="2040" data-end="2106">
<p data-start="2042" data-end="2106">Works best with MkDocs-Material, but fine on default themes too.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="2108" data-end="2111">
<p data-start="2113" data-end="2134">If you want, tell me:</p>
<p data-start="2136" data-end="2209">👉 which theme you use<br data-start="2158" data-end="2161">
