<h3 data-section-id="1s68iru" data-start="2395" data-end="2407">✅ Result</h3>
<ul data-start="2408" data-end="2557">
<li data-section-id="g7jcoy" data-start="2408" data-end="2443">
<p data-start="2410" data-end="2443">✔ No <code data-start="2415" data-end="2426">textStyle</code> class anywhere</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1tgnjxc" data-start="2444" data-end="2486">
<p data-start="2446" data-end="2486">✔ Values are <strong data-start="2459" data-end="2467">bold</strong> using <code data-start="2474" data-end="2484">&lt;strong&gt;</code></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="wroasu" data-start="2487" data-end="2523">
<p data-start="2489" data-end="2523">✔ Labels remain clean &amp; readable</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="9l0jmi" data-start="2524" data-end="2557">
<p data-start="2526" data-end="2557">✔ No logic or binding changes</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="2559" data-end="2571">If you want:</p>
<ul data-start="2572" data-end="2661">
<li data-section-id="11xhv91" data-start="2572" data-end="2601">
<p data-start="2574" data-end="2601">labels also bold/light gray</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1lvfsie" data-start="2602" data-end="2619">
<p data-start="2604" data-end="2619">colon alignment</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1to8p3z" data-start="2620" data-end="2661">
<p data-start="2622" data-end="2661">convert to reusable key–value component</p>
</li>
</ul>
