<h3 data-section-id="tq06bb" data-start="1259" data-end="1280">🔥 Recommendation</h3>
<p data-start="1281" data-end="1345">👉 <strong data-start="1284" data-end="1304">Use <code data-start="1290" data-end="1302">flex + gap</code></strong> if possible — cleanest and future-proof.</p>
<p data-start="1347" data-end="1359">If you want:</p>
