<h2 data-section-id="1aqh2yt" data-start="1437" data-end="1462">✅ FINAL RECOMMENDATION</h2>
<p data-start="1463" data-end="1543">✔ <strong data-start="1465" data-end="1504">Use <code data-start="1471" data-end="1485">btn btn-link</code> for text actions</strong><br data-start="1504" data-end="1507">
