<h3 data-section-id="8gkfw5" data-start="906" data-end="937">📌 Why this happens (short)</h3>
<ul data-start="938" data-end="1032">
<li data-section-id="1b4zcez" data-start="938" data-end="1004">
<p data-start="940" data-end="1004"><code data-start="940" data-end="984">.btn-link:hover { text-decoration: none; }</code> → Bootstrap default</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1xrgab4" data-start="1005" data-end="1032">
<p data-start="1007" data-end="1032">We override it explicitly</p>
