width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn"><div class="flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow"><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="5a71f300-85d2-40b8-a357-0348fc6a4f59" dir="auto" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-3" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="87">Ahh got it 👍 — you’re talking about <strong data-start="37" data-end="63">ChatGPT search history</strong>, not your Angular code.</p>
<h3 data-section-id="1j00npi" data-start="89" data-end="109">👉 Short answer:</h3>
<p data-start="110" data-end="274">Currently, <strong data-start="121" data-end="192">ChatGPT does NOT show date automatically on search results or chats</strong> when you search. So you can’t directly see <em data-start="236" data-end="273">“this search was done on this date”</em>.</p>
<hr data-start="276" data-end="279">
<h2 data-section-id="19m61a5" data-start="281" data-end="309">✅ Workarounds you can use</h2>
<h3 data-section-id="9f5qz7" data-start="311" data-end="347">1. Rename chats with date (BEST)</h3>
<p data-start="348" data-end="384">When you search something important:</p>
<ul data-start="385" data-end="404">
<li data-section-id="h7qfdj" data-start="385" data-end="404">
<p data-start="387" data-end="404">Rename chat like:</p>
</li>
</ul>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="405" data-end="462"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-dd80ba6x.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="w-full overflow-x-hidden overflow-y-auto pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none; max-height: 433px;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼ5 ͼj"><div class="cm-scroller"><div class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly"><span>Angular Material - 24 Mar</span><br><span>RxJS takeUntil - 18 Nov</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="464" data-end="506">👉 This is the easiest way to track later.</p>
<hr data-start="508" data-end="511">
<h3 data-section-id="1llpo4i" data-start="513" data-end="549">2. Manually add date inside chat</h3>
<p data-start="550" data-end="582">At the top of your notes, write:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="583" data-end="616"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-dd80ba6x.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="w-full overflow-x-hidden overflow-y-auto pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none; max-height: 433px;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼ5 ͼj"><div class="cm-scroller"><div class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly"><span>=== Date: 24 Mar 2026 ===</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="618" data-end="690">👉 You are already doing this (<code data-start="649" data-end="670">===date:18 th nov==</code>) — continue this 👍</p>
<hr data-start="692" data-end="695">
<h3 data-section-id="18845mj" data-start="697" data-end="725">3. Use bookmarks / notes</h3>
<p data-start="726" data-end="744">If very important:</p>
<ul data-start="745" data-end="832">
<li data-section-id="1g6xo89" data-start="745" data-end="794">
<p data-start="747" data-end="794">Copy into MkDocs (what you're already doing 👍)</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="14sbr10" data-start="795" data-end="832">
<p data-start="797" data-end="832">Or save in Notion / Notes with date</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="834" data-end="837">
<h2 data-section-id="199o5qk" data-start="839" data-end="876">❌ What is NOT possible (currently)</h2>
<ul data-start="877" data-end="987">
<li data-section-id="8t70y7" data-start="877" data-end="915">
<p data-start="879" data-end="915">❌ Auto show date in search results</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="lhrl46" data-start="916" data-end="942">
<p data-start="918" data-end="942">❌ Filter chats by date</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="15bazvi" data-start="943" data-end="987">
<p data-start="945" data-end="987">❌ Show “last searched date” like history</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="989" data-end="992">
<h2 data-section-id="29fjej" data-start="994" data-end="1023">💡 Best Practice (for you)</h2>
