<p data-start="103" data-end="247">This is <strong data-start="111" data-end="142">NOT a MkDocs config problem</strong> ❌<br data-start="144" data-end="147">
It’s almost always caused by your <strong data-start="181" data-end="246">custom JS (<code data-start="194" data-end="209">customWord.js</code>) blocking default browser behavior</strong>.</p>
<hr data-start="249" data-end="252">
<h2 data-section-id="18d3j3u" data-start="254" data-end="270">🔥 Root Cause</h2>
