 max-height: 433px;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼ5 ͼj"><div class="cm-scroller"><div class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly"><span class="ͼe">document</span><span class="ͼ8">.</span><span>addEventListener(</span><span class="ͼc">'mouseup'</span><span>, </span><span class="ͼ8">function</span><span> () {</span><br><span>  </span><span class="ͼ8">const</span><span> </span><span class="ͼe">selection</span><span> </span><span class="ͼ8">=</span><span> </span><span class="ͼe">window</span><span class="ͼ8">.</span><span>getSelection()</span><span class="ͼ8">.</span><span>toString();</span><br><span>  </span><br><span>  </span><span class="ͼ8">if</span><span> (</span><span class="ͼe">selection</span><span class="ͼ8">.</span><span>length </span><span class="ͼ8">&gt;</span><span> </span><span class="ͼb">0</span><span>) {</span><br><span>    </span><span class="ͼ8">const</span><span> </span><span class="ͼe">regex</span><span> </span><span class="ͼ8">=</span><span> </span><span class="ͼ8">new</span><span> </span><span class="ͼe">RegExp</span><span>(</span><span class="ͼe">selection</span><span>, </span><span class="ͼc">'gi'</span><span>);</span><br><span>    </span><br><span>    </span><span class="ͼe">document</span><span class="ͼ8">.</span><span>body</span><span class="ͼ8">.</span><span>innerHTML </span><span class="ͼ8">=</span><span> </span><span class="ͼe">document</span><span class="ͼ8">.</span><span>body</span><span class="ͼ8">.</span><span>innerHTML</span><span class="ͼ8">.</span><span>replace(</span><br><span>      </span><span class="ͼe">regex</span><span>,</span><br><span>      </span><span class="ͼe">match</span><span> =&gt; </span><span class="ͼc">`&lt;span class="highlight"&gt;</span><span>${</span><span class="ͼe">match</span><span>}</span><span class="ͼc">&lt;/span&gt;`</span><br><span>    );</span><br><span>  }</span><br><span>});</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<hr data-start="1469" data-end="1472">
<h2 data-section-id="jcvqhy" data-start="1474" data-end="1497">⚠️ IMPORTANT WARNING</h2>
<p data-start="1499" data-end="1516">If you are doing:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="1518" data-end="1557"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="sticky z-2 select-none top-(--sticky-padding-top)"><div class="flex w-full items-center justify-between py-1.5 ps-4 pe-1.5 font-sans md:ps-5 bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary"><div class="flex max-w-[75%] min-w-0 cursor-default items-center text-sm font-medium justify-self-start text-token-text-primary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm me-2.5 shrink-0"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-dd80ba6x.svg#e45ab3" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>JavaScript</div><div class="flex flex-row items-center gap-0.5 justify-self-end"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-dd80ba6x.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div></div></div><div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-4 top-12 bottom-4"><div class="pointer-events-none sticky z-40 shrink-0 z-1!" style="top: calc(calc(var(--sticky-padding-top) + 48px) - 1px * 3); margin-bottom: calc(-4px); height: calc(4px); mask-image: linear-gradient(transparent 25%, white 75%);"><div class="sticky bg-token-border-light" style="top: calc(var(--sticky-padding-top) + 48px); height: 1px;"></div></div></div><div class="w-full overflow-x-hidden overflow-y-auto" style="transform: none; max-height: 433px;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼ5 ͼj"><div class="cm-scroller"><div class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly"><span class="ͼe">document</span><span class="ͼ8">.</span><span>body</span><span class="ͼ8">.</span><span>innerHTML </span><span class="ͼ8">=</span><span> ...</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="1559" data-end="1645">👉 This <strong data-start="1567" data-end="1585">re-renders DOM</strong><br>
👉 It <strong data-start="1592" data-end="1645">breaks copy, events, Angular bindings, everything</strong></p>
<hr data-start="1647" data-end="1650">
<h2 data-section-id="cc4wle" data-start="1652" data-end="1684">✅ BEST APPROACH (Recommended)</h2>
<p data-start="1686" data-end="1736">Instead of replacing HTML, use CSS selection only:</p>
<h3 data-section-id="cy3m5p" data-start="1738" data-end="1773"><span role="text">✔️ Add this in <code data-start="1757" data-end="1773">customWord.css</code></span></h3>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="1775" data-end="1839"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="sticky z-2 select-none top-(--sticky-padding-top)"><div class="flex w-full items-center justify-between py-1.5 ps-4 pe-1.5 font-sans md:ps-5 bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary"><div class="flex max-w-[75%] min-w-0 cursor-default items-center text-sm font-medium justify-self-start text-token-text-primary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm me-2.5 shrink-0"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-dd80ba6x.svg#e45ab3" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>CSS</div><div class="flex flex-row items-center gap-0.5 justify-self-end"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-dd80ba6x.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div></div></div><div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-4 top-12 bottom-4"><div class="pointer-events-none sticky z-40 shrink-0 z-1!" style="top: calc(calc(var(--sticky-padding-top) + 48px) - 1px * 3); margin-bottom: calc(-4px); height: calc(4px); mask-image: linear-gradient(transparent 25%, white 75%);"><div class="sticky bg-token-border-light" style="top: calc(var(--sticky-padding-top) + 48px); height: 1px;"></div></div></div><div class="w-full overflow-x-hidden overflow-y-auto" style="transform: none; max-height: 433px;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼ5 ͼj"><div class="cm-scroller"><div class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly"><span>::</span><span class="ͼd">selection</span><span> {</span><br><span>  background: </span><span class="ͼb">yellow</span><span>;</span><br><span>  color: </span><span class="ͼb">black</span><span>;</span><br><span>}</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="1841" data-end="1849">👉 This:</p>
<ul data-start="1850" data-end="1932">
<li data-section-id="v5o3bz" data-start="1850" data-end="1876">
<p data-start="1852" data-end="1876">Highlights selected text</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="dig5ne" data-start="1877" data-end="1898">
<p data-start="1879" data-end="1898">DOES NOT break copy</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1srrumy" data-start="1899" data-end="1932">
<p data-start="1901" data-end="1932">Works perfectly with Ctrl + C ✅</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="1934" data-end="1937">
<h2 data-section-id="1da55br" data-start="1939" data-end="1980">💡 If you want BOTH (Highlight + Copy)</h2>
<p data-start="1982" data-end="1987">Then:</p>
<ul data-start="1988" data-end="2076">
<li data-section-id="174woll" data-start="1988" data-end="2017">
<p data-start="1990" data-end="2017">❌ Do NOT modify <code data-start="2006" data-end="2017">innerHTML</code></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1dhxfh8" data-start="2018" data-end="2049">
<p data-start="2020" data-end="2049">❌ Do NOT use <code data-start="2033" data-end="2049">preventDefault</code></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="e9suwq" data-start="2050" data-end="2076">
<p data-start="2052" data-end="2076">✅ Only use <code data-start="2063" data-end="2076">::selection</code></p>
</li>
</ul>
