<h2 data-section-id="1cgty6v" data-start="2163" data-end="2185">✅ Final Fix Summary</h2>
<p data-start="2187" data-end="2290">✔ Remove <code data-start="2196" data-end="2214">preventDefault()</code> from JS<br data-start="2222" data-end="2225">
✔ Don’t overwrite <code data-start="2243" data-end="2254">innerHTML</code><br data-start="2254" data-end="2257">
✔ Use CSS <code data-start="2267" data-end="2280">::selection</code> instead</p>
