<h2 data-section-id="le1s6r" data-start="197" data-end="235">❌ Problem in your previous approach</h2>
<ul data-start="236" data-end="333">
<li data-section-id="1pwxujt" data-start="236" data-end="280">
<p data-start="238" data-end="280">You were replacing DOM nodes → breaks copy</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="f8f8it" data-start="281" data-end="333">
<p data-start="283" data-end="333">Or only highlighting selected portion → not global</p>
</li>
</ul>
