<h2 data-section-id="18cf3oc" data-start="2406" data-end="2430">🎯 Why this is BETTER</h2>
<p data-start="2432" data-end="2552">✔ No duplicate CSS<br data-start="2450" data-end="2453">
✔ Doesn’t break copy (Ctrl + C works)<br data-start="2490" data-end="2493">
✔ Highlights <strong data-start="2506" data-end="2533">all occurrences in page</strong><br data-start="2533" data-end="2536">
✔ Doesn’t touch:</p>
<ul data-start="2553" data-end="2633">
