<h2 data-section-id="19pcs5l" data-start="2640" data-end="2665">🚀 Bonus (Recommended)</h2>
<h3 data-section-id="1dzas8k" data-start="2667" data-end="2711">👉 Clear highlight when clicking outside</h3>
